    <!-- Migration Center -->
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Migration.Title">Migration Center</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Migration.Subtitle">Carry out your saved plan, one step at a time. Every step is re-checked against the disk and confirmed by you before anything happens.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str.Migration.SafetyNote">This is the only page that changes your files. Deletions go to the Recycle Bin, never permanently. A move copies first, verifies the copy against the original, and only then recycles the original — so your data always exists somewhere you can reach it.</sys:String>
